// The ribbon: a row of tabs naming the kinds of work over one band that holds the tab in front's
// tools, each a glyph over its label, in named groups with a hairline between them. In a window
// as narrow as a phone it is one row: the tab's select (the interface's own, in a hole) and the
// tab's tools as icon keys. The view only: which tools there are, which of them fit and what
// each one says is shaped in TypeScript (src/slab/ribbon-params.ts, over the model the SolidJS
// strip draws: src/ribbon.ts); a press comes back as a signal.
//
// No node binds `pointer-move`: at this commit every signal a node emits asks for a frame, so a
// binder on the tools would solve and paint the ribbon again on every move of the pointer over
// it. The host finds the control under the pointer in the solved scene instead (for the hint),
// and the kernel paints only when the pointer goes from one control to another. For the same
// reason a control's glyph and label are `inert` (the pointer going from one to the other inside
// a tool would change the hit path, and so paint), and no control eases its state with
// `transition=`: the kernel plays one as a frame per step, six for the interface's 100 ms, each a
// whole solve of the ribbon, where the SolidJS strip's fade costs the page nothing. A fill under
// the pointer is there at once here. (Measured: a pointer drawn across the band asked for 192
// frames with the ease and 38 without.)
//
// Measures follow src/ribbon.css and src/ui/ui.css (.ui-button--ghost, .ui-tab--sm,
// .ui-icon-button): the tab row is a button high, a tab the row's 22 with 12px type on a 6 inset;
// a tool is 38 high and never narrower than 41, its 16 glyph 4 from the top over one 12px line of
// 11px label; the band is 58 with its top hairline, a group's caption 3 from its foot.
import "gen/tokens.slab"

tokens {
  ribbon {
    // A tool: 4 + the glyph's 16 + 3 + one line of label (12) + 3; never narrower than a tab's
    // height and 6 (ribbon.css: `.ribbon-cell > .ui-button`).
    tool 38; tool-min 41
    // The band under its top hairline: 2 + a tool + 2 + the caption's line + 4, less the hairline.
    band 57
    // A group's divider: the band less 8 above and below.
    rule 42
    // The label's and the caption's line: 12px of 11px type.
    leading 1.0909
    // The press of an icon key (ui.css: `.ui-icon-button:active`).
    press 0.98
    // No cap on a caption's width: the group is as wide as its tools or its caption.
    open 100000
  }
}

